# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) to build binaries that carry the shared
# "Lybel Skills" OAuth app, the same way the release workflow does.
#
#   cp .env.local.example .env.local   # then fill in the value
#   cd confluence-docs/cli && make login
#
# The value is the Client Secret from https://developer.atlassian.com/console/myapps/
# → Lybel Skills → Settings. In CI it comes from the ATLASSIAN_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET
# repository secret instead.
#
# Plain KEY=value, no quotes and no `export` — the Makefiles read this file
# directly. To load it into a shell instead: set -a; . ./.env.local; set +a
ATLASSIAN_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
